projectDescription:
The fault tolerance of search lies in the distribution of the main components in a decentralized network IPFS + FEVM.
How does it work ?



Indexing the content of the web page (search all images on a page);




Sending metadata to the decentralized IPFS storage using API web3.stotage (only data about alt tag and image link);




CID IPFS metadata is written in the FEVM smart contract (an array of IPFS CID metadata is stored in the blockchain);




Search by metadata that will be received from FEVM (all metadata from the blockchain is loaded into the browser memory and indexed).

howItsMade:
It was made by collecting people's data and translate into a programmable NFT with a hidden stenography information and wallet address in the image to retrieve the data.
The goal is to use Filecoin IPFS in the FEVM to storage the programmable NFT`s;
Polygon ZK-ID to allow people match and monetize their data with privacity,
Chainlink VRN to play again the I-ching Oracle;
Geolocation to allow people meet in the real life and Whether that influences the people mood.
Moralis as .NET framework.

There are 2 main elements made up to this project:

Soulbound ERC1155 NFT - Ensures that the NFT can be traded only within the DAO ecosystem means the royalty and represents a license given to the token holders.
